# Docs

Knowledge Claude (and people) read on demand. Nothing here is loaded into every session;
CLAUDE.md only points at it. Keep each file focused and under a few hundred lines.

| File | Read it when… |
|---|---|
| [architecture.md](architecture.md) | changing how parts fit together, adding a module or service |
| [api-contracts.md](api-contracts.md) | touching an endpoint, a public function or a message format |
| [data-models.md](data-models.md) | changing schemas, migrations or core types |
| [debugging.md](debugging.md) | something is broken and the cause isn't obvious |
